"""Lightweight validation script for the upstream pipeline outputs.

Validated artifacts (all relative to the workspace ``outputs/`` folder):

* ``t01_selected_indicators.csv``
* ``t05_clean_stops.csv``
* ``t08_pois_clean.csv``
* ``t10_accessibility_scores.csv``
* ``t13_city_clusters.csv``

Each check is executed independently and recorded as an entry with
``check_name``, ``passed`` and ``message``.  A missing, empty or malformed
output produces a *failed* check instead of an exception, so the script always
finishes and always writes ``outputs/t14_validation_summary.json``.

Usage (from the workspace root)::

    python src/validate_outputs.py

Exit code is 0 when every check passes and 1 otherwise (the summary file is
written in both cases).
